{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab the object. If approached, grab it, check its properties, perform specific task. If visible, move to it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
